    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228450/extras/8d0c0a126f9627259969d9ac14f0e1bb.avif?t=1676474094\" /></div><br>Tank Commander is a single-player arcade action game built for Virtual Reality. Take command of a main battle tank and fight against various types of modern military hardware!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Turret Tossing Mayhem</h2>\tEnjoy fast-paced arcade action while piloting a main battle tank!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228450/extras/5b6235ca14f6dab63aee2089bcf760fc.poster.avif?t=1676474094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228450/extras/5b6235ca14f6dab63aee2089bcf760fc.webm?t=1676474094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228450/extras/5b6235ca14f6dab63aee2089bcf760fc.mp4?t=1676474094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiple Weapon Types</h2>\tEngage enemies with cannons, machine guns, and grenades!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228450/extras/69d2295c7d593243d4aeb8bb3844b324.poster.avif?t=1676474094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228450/extras/69d2295c7d593243d4aeb8bb3844b324.webm?t=1676474094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228450/extras/69d2295c7d593243d4aeb8bb3844b324.mp4?t=1676474094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Try to save the world in Story Mode</h2>\tStop an evil military corporation from conquering the world!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Test your skills in Arca